cmu-uppline-name-rifleman = UPP Line Infantry Rifleman
cmu-uppline-name-medic = UPP Line Infantry Medic
cmu-uppline-name-sapper = UPP Line Infantry Sapper
cmu-uppline-name-specialist = UPP Line Infantry Specialist
cmu-uppline-name-leader = UPP Line Infantry Squad Leader
cmu-uppline-name-commando = UPP Naval Infantry Commando
cmu-uppline-name-commando-medic = UPP Naval Infantry Commando Medic
cmu-uppline-name-commando-leader = UPP Naval Infantry Commando Leader
cmu-uppline-name-synthetic = UPP Support Synthetic
cmu-uppline-description = A soldier of the Union of Progressive Peoples' line infantry, deployed to secure Union interests in the sector by any means necessary.
cmu-uppline-description-commando = An elite commando of the Union of Progressive Peoples' naval infantry, trained for deep operations behind enemy lines.
cmu-uppline-description-synthetic = A Union of Progressive Peoples support synthetic, programmed to keep the squad fighting.
cmu-uppline-prefix-rifleman = RFN
cmu-uppline-prefix-medic = MED
cmu-uppline-prefix-sapper = SAP
cmu-uppline-prefix-specialist = SPC
cmu-uppline-prefix-leader = SL
cmu-uppline-prefix-commando = CMD
cmu-uppline-prefix-commando-medic = CM
cmu-uppline-prefix-commando-leader = CTL
cmu-uppline-prefix-synthetic = SYN
cmu-uppline-leader = the UPP squad leader
cmu-uppline-rules = You are a soldier of the Union of Progressive Peoples. Follow your squad leader, complete your mission, and remember: the Union does not forget its own. You are hostile to the TWE and any enemy of the Union, and neutral to everyone else unless provoked.
cmu-uppline-greeting = You are a soldier of the Union of Progressive Peoples line infantry. Your squad has been deployed to this theatre to secure Union interests. Follow your squad leader and complete the mission. Slava!
cmu-upp-kommissar-name = UPP Kommissar
cmu-upp-kommissar-description = A Union political officer attached to the line. The Revolution gave you a pistol and a mandate; you decide which is more persuasive today.
cmu-upp-division-kommissar-name = UPP Division Kommissar
cmu-upp-division-kommissar-description = A senior Union political officer of division rank. Where you walk, commanders straighten their backs or explain themselves.
cmu-upp-kommissar-prefix = KOM
cmu-upp-division-kommissar-prefix = DKM
cmu-upp-kommissar-supervisors = the Union political directorate
cmu-upp-kommissar-greeting = You are a Union political officer embedded with the line infantry. Watch the men, watch the officers, and make sure the Union's will is done whatever the battlefield says.
cmu-upp-kommissar-rules = You are a UPP kommissar. You are a normal human who can be killed by any threat. Enforce the Union's will on its own soldiers first and its enemies second.
